{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-patterns","title":"跨平台架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/cross-platform-fundamentals/architecture-patterns","wordCount":1309,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨平台架构模式\">跨平台架构模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨平台开发的核心挑战在于如何用一套代码覆盖多个目标平台，同时兼顾性能、开发效率和用户体验。经过十余年的演进，业界沉淀出四种主流架构模式：<strong>Web 容器模式</strong>、<strong>桥接模式</strong>、<strong>自渲染模式</strong>和<strong>编译转换模式</strong>。每种模式在底层实现机制、性能表现、开发体验和适用场景上各有侧重，架构选型直接决定了项目的技术上限和长期维护成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四大架构模式总览\">四大架构模式总览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[跨平台架构模式] --&gt; B[Web 容器模式]&#10;    A --&gt; C[桥接模式]&#10;    A --&gt; D[自渲染模式]&#10;    A --&gt; E[编译转换模式]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Cordova / Ionic]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[PWA]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[小程序]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[React Native]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Lynx]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[NativeScript]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Flutter]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[Unity]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[Qt]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; E1[Kotlin Multiplatform]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[Xamarin / .NET MAUI]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[Compose Multiplatform]\">graph TB\n    A[跨平台架构模式] --&gt; B[Web 容器模式]\n    A --&gt; C[桥接模式]\n    A --&gt; D[自渲染模式]\n    A --&gt; E[编译转换模式]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[Cordova / Ionic]\n    B --&gt; B2[PWA]\n    B --&gt; B3[小程序]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[React Native]\n    C --&gt; C2[Lynx]\n    C --&gt; C3[NativeScript]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[Flutter]\n    D --&gt; D2[Unity]\n    D --&gt; D3[Qt]\n\n    E --&gt; E1[Kotlin Multiplatform]\n    E --&gt; E2[Xamarin / .NET MAUI]\n    E --&gt; E3[Compose Multiplatform]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>核心原理</th>\n<th>代表框架</th>\n<th>渲染方式</th>\n<th>性能基准</th>\n<th>开发语言</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Web 容器</td>\n<td>应用运行在 WebView 中</td>\n<td>Cordova, Ionic, PWA</td>\n<td>WebView</td>\n<td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n<td>HTML/CSS/JS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桥接</td>\n<td>JS 逻辑通过桥接调用原生组件</td>\n<td>React Native, Lynx</td>\n<td>原生组件</td>\n<td>★★★★☆</td>\n<td>JS/TS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自渲染</td>\n<td>框架自带渲染引擎绘制 UI</td>\n<td>Flutter, Qt</td>\n<td>Skia/Impeller</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n<td>Dart/C++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译转换</td>\n<td>编译为各平台原生代码</td>\n<td>KMP, .NET MAUI</td>\n<td>原生组件</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n<td>Kotlin/C#</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"web-容器模式\">Web 容器模式</h2><p>Web 容器模式是跨平台的最早实践者。其核心思想极为简单——在原生应用中嵌入一个 WebView，将 Web 页面作为应用的 UI 层。原生能力通过 JavaScript Bridge 暴露给 Web 侧。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph WebView容器&#10;        A[HTML/CSS/JS] --&gt; B[DOM 渲染引擎]&#10;        B --&gt; C[屏幕像素]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt;|JS Bridge| D[原生 API]&#10;    D --&gt; E[相机/GPS/文件系统]\">graph LR\n    subgraph WebView容器\n        A[HTML/CSS/JS] --&gt; B[DOM 渲染引擎]\n        B --&gt; C[屏幕像素]\n    end\n    A --&gt;|JS Bridge| D[原生 API]\n    D --&gt; E[相机/GPS/文件系统]</pre><h3 id=\"cordova-插件架构\">Cordova 插件架构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Camera, CameraResultType } from &#39;@capacitor/camera&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function takePhoto() {&#10;  const image = await Camera.getPhoto({&#10;    quality: 90,&#10;    allowEditing: true,&#10;    resultType: CameraResultType.Uri,&#10;  });&#10;  return image.webPath;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Camera, CameraResultType } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@capacitor/camera'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> takePhoto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Camera.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPhoto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    quality: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    allowEditing: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resultType: CameraResultType.Uri,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image.webPath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Geolocation } from &#39;@capacitor/geolocation&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function getCurrentPosition() {&#10;  const coordinates = await Geolocation.getCurrentPosition();&#10;  return {&#10;    lat: coordinates.coords.latitude,&#10;    lng: coordinates.coords.longitude,&#10;    accuracy: coordinates.coords.accuracy,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Geolocation } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@capacitor/geolocation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getCurrentPosition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coordinates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Geolocation.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCurrentPosition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lat: coordinates.coords.latitude,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lng: coordinates.coords.longitude,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    accuracy: coordinates.coords.accuracy,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"优缺点分析\">优缺点分析</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发效率</td>\n<td>Web 技术栈直接复用，学习成本最低</td>\n<td>复杂交互性能瓶颈明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 一致性</td>\n<td>各平台表现完全一致</td>\n<td>与原生 UI 风格不统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>简单页面可接受</td>\n<td>列表滚动、动画卡顿严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生能力</td>\n<td>通过插件访问</td>\n<td>插件生态质量参差不齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>WebView 由系统提供，包体小</td>\n<td>iOS WKWebView 内存占用较高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"桥接模式\">桥接模式</h2><p>桥接模式的核心在于 JS 线程和原生线程之间的通信机制。开发者用 JavaScript/TypeScript 编写业务逻辑和 UI 描述，框架将 UI 描述翻译为原生组件的创建/更新指令，通过桥接层传递到原生线程执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant JS as JS 线程&#10;    participant Bridge as 桥接层&#10;    participant Native as 原生线程&#10;    participant UI as UI 线程&#10;&#10;    JS-&gt;&gt;Bridge: 序列化 UI 指令&#10;    Bridge-&gt;&gt;Native: 反序列化 &amp; 解析&#10;    Native-&gt;&gt;UI: 创建/更新原生组件&#10;    UI--&gt;&gt;Native: 用户事件&#10;    Native--&gt;&gt;Bridge: 事件序列化&#10;    Bridge--&gt;&gt;JS: 事件回调\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant JS as JS 线程\n    participant Bridge as 桥接层\n    participant Native as 原生线程\n    participant UI as UI 线程\n\n    JS-&gt;&gt;Bridge: 序列化 UI 指令\n    Bridge-&gt;&gt;Native: 反序列化 &amp; 解析\n    Native-&gt;&gt;UI: 创建/更新原生组件\n    UI--&gt;&gt;Native: 用户事件\n    Native--&gt;&gt;Bridge: 事件序列化\n    Bridge--&gt;&gt;JS: 事件回调</pre><h3 id=\"react-native-桥接通信-旧架构\">React Native 桥接通信（旧架构）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { NativeModules, NativeEventEmitter } from &#39;react-native&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { DeviceInfoModule } = NativeModules;&#10;&#10;async function getBatteryLevel(): Promise&lt;number&gt; {&#10;  const level = await DeviceInfoModule.getBatteryLevel();&#10;  return level;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const eventEmitter = new NativeEventEmitter(DeviceInfoModule);&#10;&#10;const subscription = eventEmitter.addListener(&#39;onBatteryLevelChange&#39;, (event: { level: number }) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(`Battery: ${event.level}%`);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NativeModules, NativeEventEmitter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-native'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DeviceInfoModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NativeModules;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getBatteryLevel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DeviceInfoModule.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getBatteryLevel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> level;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> eventEmitter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NativeEventEmitter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(DeviceInfoModule);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> subscription</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventEmitter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'onBatteryLevelChange'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Battery: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">level</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}%`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"react-native-jsi-新架构\">React Native JSI（新架构）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;jsi/jsi.h&gt;&#10;&#10;using namespace facebook::jsi;&#10;&#10;void installMathModule(Runtime&amp; runtime) {&#10;  auto multiply = Function::createFromHostFunction(&#10;    runtime,&#10;    PropNameID::forAscii(runtime, &quot;multiply&quot;),&#10;    2,&#10;    [](Runtime&amp; rt, const Value&amp;, const Value* args, size_t) -&gt; Value {&#10;      double a = args[0].asNumber();&#10;      double b = args[1].asNumber();&#10;      return Value(a * b);&#10;    }&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  runtime.global().setProperty(&#10;    runtime,&#10;    &quot;nativeMultiply&quot;,&#10;    std::move(multiply)&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;jsi/jsi.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></s